;+------------------------------------------------------------------
;| HEX-FVG-Breaker - DOGEUSD M5 scalp (second instance, TMGM)
;+------------------------------------------------------------------
; Same engine, different job. Volume/scalp tuning for a 24/7 crypto pair,
; not the gold swing tuning. Read this before trusting any number:
;
; * Every *_Dollars input is in PRICE units. DOGE near $0.20 means a stop of
;   0.003, not 1.20. If DOGE has moved a long way from there, re-read the
;   stop bracket (MinStopDollars/MaxStopDollars) before starting it.
; * Trend is EMA-only (TrendMode 0) on M30 over M5 entries: structure
;   confirmation on an instrument that just moved 3% is a veto, not a filter.
; * Confluence is off - an FVG that also overlaps a breaker is rare on M5,
;   and this instance wants many small trades, not six well-fed ones.
; * One target at 1R, all of it, breakeven at 0.55R, no trail: small wins
;   taken off the table instead of runners given back.
; * Session 0-24 and CloseOnWeekend 0, because crypto does not close.
;
; Sizing is by risk (0.5% of equity), not by lots: a DOGE lot is not a gold
; lot, and the margin guard plus MaxLot are what actually bound it.
;
; Watch rejections.csv on day one: 'spread > 0.0008' means the broker's
; normal spread is wider than this assumes, so raise MaxSpreadDollars to
; just above what Market Watch shows.
;
; differs from the EA default:
;   MagicNumber: 20261015  ->  20261016
;   MaxSpreadDollars: 0.45  ->  0.0008
;   MaxSignalsPerDay: 6  ->  40
;   CloseOnWeekend: 1  ->  0
;   StopTradingHourUTC: 21  ->  24
;   StartTradingHourUTC: 1  ->  0
;   TrendTimeframe: 60  ->  30
;   TrendMode: 2  ->  0
;   FastEMAPeriod: 21  ->  9
;   SlowEMAPeriod: 50  ->  21
;   MinTrendSlopeDollars: 0.15  ->  0.0002
;   MaxDistFromEmaDollars: 9.00  ->  0.004
;   SwingLookback: 3  ->  2
;   MinSwingRangeDollars: 1.20  ->  0.0015
;   MinDisplacementPct: 55.0  ->  50.0
;   MinDisplacementAtr: 1.10  ->  0.90
;   FvgMinSizeAtrPct: 55  ->  30
;   FvgMaxSizeAtrPct: 420  ->  250
;   MitigatePct: 50.0  ->  45.0
;   EntryZonePct: 62.0  ->  55.0
;   MaxZoneAgeBars: 180  ->  36
;   RequireFVGConfluence: 1  ->  0
;   ConfluenceLookback: 60  ->  30
;   BreakerMinAtr: 0.70  ->  0.50
;   BreakerMaxAtr: 6.0  ->  4.0
;   MitigConsolBars: 4  ->  3
;   MitigConsolAtrMax: 0.65  ->  0.70
;   MitigBreakAtr: 1.20  ->  1.10
;   EntryModel: 0  ->  1
;   MaxEntryDistanceDollars: 7.00  ->  0.004
;   MinRejectionWickPct: 30.0  ->  25.0
;   MinTriggerRangeAtr: 0.35  ->  0.30
;   MinTriggerClosePct: 45.0  ->  40.0
;   MaxBarsSinceTouch: 6  ->  3
;   LimitExpiryBars: 4  ->  2
;   RiskPercent: 0.0  ->  0.5
;   MaxLot: 0.02  ->  0.20
;   MaxMarginUsagePct: 50.0  ->  20
;   StopBufferAtrPct: 25.0  ->  20.0
;   MinStopDollars: 1.20  ->  0.0015
;   MaxStopDollars: 14.00  ->  0.012
;   Tp1Percent: 50.0  ->  100.0
;   Tp2RR: 2.5  ->  2.0
;   BreakEvenTriggerRR: 0.80  ->  0.55
;   BreakEvenOffsetDollars: 0.05  ->  0.0001
;   UseAtrTrail: 1  ->  0
;   TrailStartRR: 1.0  ->  1.2
;   MinHoldBars: 2  ->  0
;   MaxDailyLossPct: 5.0  ->  3.0
;   MaxTotalDrawdownPct: 15.0  ->  10.0
;   MinFreeMarginUsd: 40.0  ->  20
;   NotifyUrl:   ->  https://ntfy.sh/hex-doge-b652c737
;   NotifyTitle: HEX XAUUSD  ->  HEX DOGEUSD
;   NotifyMinMinutes: 2  ->  1
;   NotifyMaxPerHour: 30  ->  60
;-------------------------------------------------------------------
